{"seq":55,"slug":"operations-research","title":"运筹学与数学规划","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运筹学与数学规划-用模型求最优决策\">运筹学与数学规划：用模型求最优决策</h1><p>运筹学（Operations Research，OR）是一门<strong>用数学模型在约束条件下寻求最优决策</strong>的应用学科。从 20 世纪二战时期的军事资源调度起步，如今已渗透到工业调度、供应链管理、金融优化、机器学习训练策略等软件工程师日常工作的核心场景。</p>\n<p>本 hub 的目标受众是<strong>中级程序员</strong>——你懂线性代数、会写代码，但可能从未系统学过&quot;LP 建模&quot;或&quot;分支定界&quot;。我们从可行域的几何直觉出发，逐步抵达实用的求解器调用和工程落地。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"运筹学解决什么问题\">运筹学解决什么问题</h2><p>一个典型的 OR 问题由三部分构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>决策变量</strong></td>\n<td>你能控制什么</td>\n<td>每种产品生产多少件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>目标函数</strong></td>\n<td>优化什么</td>\n<td>最大化利润</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>约束</strong></td>\n<td>受什么限制</td>\n<td>产能、原料、时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数学上写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{x} \\; c^T x \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad Ax \\leq b, \\; x \\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5913em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是**线性规划（LP）**的标准形式。当变量要求整数时变为整数规划（IP），目标或约束非线性时变为非线性规划（NLP）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的结构\">本 Hub 的结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[运筹学与数学规划] --&gt; B[第1章 线性规划]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第2章 整数与组合优化]&#10;    A --&gt; D[第3章 非线性与随机规划]&#10;    A --&gt; E[第4章 应用与工具]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[LP 建模与几何]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[单纯形法]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[对偶与灵敏度]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[整数规划与分支定界]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[网络优化]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[组合优化算法]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[凸优化基础]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[随机规划]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[元启发式算法]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[调度与分配]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[供应链与路径]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[求解器与工具]\">graph TD\n    A[运筹学与数学规划] --&gt; B[第1章 线性规划]\n    A --&gt; C[第2章 整数与组合优化]\n    A --&gt; D[第3章 非线性与随机规划]\n    A --&gt; E[第4章 应用与工具]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[LP 建模与几何]\n    B --&gt; B2[单纯形法]\n    B --&gt; B3[对偶与灵敏度]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[整数规划与分支定界]\n    C --&gt; C2[网络优化]\n    C --&gt; C3[组合优化算法]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[凸优化基础]\n    D --&gt; D2[随机规划]\n    D --&gt; D3[元启发式算法]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[调度与分配]\n    E --&gt; E2[供应链与路径]\n    E --&gt; E3[求解器与工具]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 Hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 专注于<strong>决策优化的建模与算法</strong>，与下列相邻方向各有侧重：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相邻 Hub</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>边界说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>优化理论</strong>（<code>05_optimization-theory</code>）</td>\n<td>数学基础</td>\n<td>优化理论讲收敛性证明、梯度流；本 hub 讲 LP/IP/NLP 的建模范式与实用算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>图论</strong>（<code>13_graph-theory</code>）</td>\n<td>工具重叠</td>\n<td>图论讲图的结构性质；本 hub 从 OR 视角用图做网络流、TSP 建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>博弈论</strong>（<code>16_game-theory</code>）</td>\n<td>应用交叉</td>\n<td>博弈论讲多方决策均衡；OR 讲单决策者在约束下的最优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>排队论</strong>（<code>27_queueing-theory</code>）</td>\n<td>场景互补</td>\n<td>排队论建系统性能模型；OR 在此基础上做容量规划与调度决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>组合数学</strong>（<code>14_combinatorics</code>）</td>\n<td>计数工具</td>\n<td>组合数学提供可行解的计数框架；OR 要在指数空间高效求最优解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S[起点:理解线性规划] --&gt; LP建模与几何&#10;    LP建模与几何 --&gt; 单纯形法&#10;    单纯形法 --&gt; 对偶与灵敏度&#10;    对偶与灵敏度 --&gt; 整数规划与分支定界&#10;    整数规划与分支定界 --&gt; 网络优化&#10;    网络优化 --&gt; 组合优化算法&#10;    对偶与灵敏度 --&gt; 凸优化基础&#10;    凸优化基础 --&gt; 随机规划&#10;    随机规划 --&gt; 元启发式算法&#10;    整数规划与分支定界 --&gt; 调度与分配&#10;    网络优化 --&gt; 供应链与路径&#10;    调度与分配 --&gt; 求解器与工具&#10;    供应链与路径 --&gt; 求解器与工具\">graph LR\n    S[起点:理解线性规划] --&gt; LP建模与几何\n    LP建模与几何 --&gt; 单纯形法\n    单纯形法 --&gt; 对偶与灵敏度\n    对偶与灵敏度 --&gt; 整数规划与分支定界\n    整数规划与分支定界 --&gt; 网络优化\n    网络优化 --&gt; 组合优化算法\n    对偶与灵敏度 --&gt; 凸优化基础\n    凸优化基础 --&gt; 随机规划\n    随机规划 --&gt; 元启发式算法\n    整数规划与分支定界 --&gt; 调度与分配\n    网络优化 --&gt; 供应链与路径\n    调度与分配 --&gt; 求解器与工具\n    供应链与路径 --&gt; 求解器与工具</pre><p><strong>快速通道（工程师实战）</strong>：LP 建模 → 单纯形法 → 整数规划 → 求解器与工具。掌握这四篇，你就能用 Python+Gurobi/OR-Tools 解决大多数工程优化问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识点</th>\n<th>掌握程度</th>\n<th>用在哪里</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性代数（矩阵运算、秩）</td>\n<td>熟悉</td>\n<td>单纯形法的 tableau 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微积分（偏导数、梯度）</td>\n<td>了解</td>\n<td>KKT 条件、凸优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python 基础</td>\n<td>熟练</td>\n<td>代码示例全用 Python</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图的基本概念（节点、边）</td>\n<td>了解</td>\n<td>网络优化章节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>第1章：<a href=\"/linear-programming/\">线性规划</a> — LP 建模的三种标准写法与几何直觉</li>\n<li>第2章：<a href=\"integer-combinatorial/\">整数与组合优化</a> — 整数规划的精确算法与近似策略</li>\n<li>第3章：<a href=\"nonlinear-stochastic/\">非线性与随机规划</a> — 超越 LP 的优化世界</li>\n<li>第4章：<a href=\"applications/\">应用与工具</a> — 工程实战：调度、VRP、求解器</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-programming","title":"第1章：线性规划","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/linear-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lp-formulation-geometry","title":"LP 建模与几何解释：从现实到多面体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/linear-programming/lp-formulation-geometry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simplex-method","title":"单纯形法：从顶点到顶点的系统搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/linear-programming/simplex-method"},{"seq":3,"slug":"duality-sensitivity","title":"对偶理论与灵敏度分析：最优解的稳健性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/linear-programming/duality-sensitivity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"integer-combinatorial","title":"第2章：整数与组合优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integer-programming","title":"整数规划与分支定界：离散决策的精确求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/integer-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-optimization","title":"网络优化：流量与路径的最优调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/network-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"combinatorial-algorithms","title":"组合优化算法：NP-hard 问题的精确与近似策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/combinatorial-algorithms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nonlinear-stochastic","title":"第3章：非线性与随机规划","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/nonlinear-stochastic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"convex-optimization","title":"凸优化基础：非线性但有保证的最优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/nonlinear-stochastic/convex-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stochastic-programming","title":"随机规划：不确定性下的最优决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/nonlinear-stochastic/stochastic-programming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaheuristics","title":"元启发式算法：大规模 NP-hard 问题的实用利器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/nonlinear-stochastic/metaheuristics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"第4章：应用与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scheduling-assignment","title":"调度与分配问题：任务、时间与资源的最优匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/applications/scheduling-assignment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-routing","title":"供应链与路径优化：从仓库到客户的最优配送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/applications/supply-chain-routing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"solver-tooling","title":"求解器与建模工具：从模型到代码的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/applications/solver-tooling"}]}]}